error: `range` can only be used as the iterable of a `for` loop
 --> main.ty:2:9
  |
2 |     r = range(10)
  |         ^^^^^^^^^ not a value
  |
  = note: `range` compiles to a counting loop and never builds an object, see DESIGN.md section 3.5
